\qc\b\fs48 MISSING HAMSTER!\b0\fs20\par
\qc\par
\qc\b\fs36 Mr. Nibbles\b0\fs20\par
\qc\par
\ql\fs24 Mr. Nibbles is a small orange and white hamster with a round white face. He is shy, but he loves sunflower seeds and warm, cosy places.\fs20\par
\par
\fs24 He got out of his cage this week. He may be hiding in a box, a drawer or a cupboard. Please look!\fs20\par
\par
\fs24 Our daughter misses him very much.\fs20\par
\par
\qc\b\fs28 Have you seen him? Call 08-555 318 62\b0\fs20\par
